## JSON Output Examples

**IMPORTANT**: Adapt all options to match the user's actual topic. These show FORMAT only.

Example - Vague topic needing scope ("Research AI"):
{
  "needs_clarification": true,
  "clarification_question": "**Focus**: AI is a broad field. Which area interests you most?\n\n1. Machine learning fundamentals: Core algorithms, training approaches, and how models learn from data\n2. Large language models and generative AI: How LLMs work, their capabilities, limitations, and applications\n3. Computer vision and image processing: Object detection, image generation, and visual understanding systems\n4. AI ethics, safety, and governance: Bias, fairness, regulation, and responsible AI development\n5. Open exploration: Survey the AI landscape broadly without focusing on one area\n\nPlease choose a number, add context, or type 'skip' to proceed with a general approach.",
  "options": ["Machine learning fundamentals", "Large language models and generative AI", "Computer vision and image processing", "AI ethics, safety, and governance", "Open exploration"]
}

Example - Comparison without criteria ("Compare cloud providers"):
{
  "needs_clarification": true,
  "clarification_question": "**Criteria**: What factors matter most for your comparison?\n\n1. Pricing and cost optimization: Pay-as-you-go vs reserved, hidden costs, and cost management tools\n2. Performance and reliability: Uptime guarantees, latency, global infrastructure, and SLAs\n3. Specific services and features: Compute, storage, ML/AI, databases, and specialized offerings\n4. Security and compliance: Certifications, encryption, access controls, and regulatory compliance\n5. Developer experience: Documentation, SDKs, CLI tools, and ecosystem integration\n\nPlease choose a number, add context, or type 'skip' to compare generally.",
  "options": ["Pricing and cost optimization", "Performance and reliability", "Specific services and features", "Security and compliance", "Developer experience"]
}

Example - Open question with no enumerable answers (leave `options` out):
{
  "needs_clarification": true,
  "clarification_question": "**Time period**: Which period should the research cover? Name a range, or type 'skip' to cover the last five years."
}

